  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 980,
      "end_ms": 3020,
      "text": "啊我们要讲这个谬误之路的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 3020,
      "end_ms": 7130,
      "text": "这个就是就是或者说意见之路就是愚者的思维"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 7130,
      "end_ms": 11300,
      "text": "蠢货笨蛋大傻x的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 11300,
      "end_ms": 15430,
      "text": "他们的思维就是我们你已经学哲学了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 15430,
      "end_ms": 16149,
      "text": "入门了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 16149,
      "end_ms": 17710,
      "text": "这个时候你可以狂妄"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 17710,
      "end_ms": 18280,
      "text": "没问题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 18280,
      "end_ms": 22860,
      "text": "这个时候你可以说甚至说很多哲学系的学生呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 23920,
      "end_ms": 26340,
      "text": "全人类99.999%的人口"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 26340,
      "end_ms": 28320,
      "text": "他们都过不了这一关"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 28320,
      "end_ms": 30810,
      "text": "就是对于谬误之路的正确理解"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 30810,
      "end_ms": 33940,
      "text": "因为这个东西这个东西很"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 35540,
      "end_ms": 36580,
      "text": "就很简单"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 36580,
      "end_ms": 37300,
      "text": "因为太简单了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 37300,
      "end_ms": 38140,
      "text": "很多人不相信"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 38140,
      "end_ms": 39070,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 39070,
      "end_ms": 40820,
      "text": "所以他谬误之路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 41800,
      "end_ms": 46950,
      "text": "意见之路很明确的就是第一句话叫做存在者不存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 46950,
      "end_ms": 48779,
      "text": "存在者不存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 49560,
      "end_ms": 50540,
      "text": "纯粹是不存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 50540,
      "end_ms": 52700,
      "text": "有的人会觉得哇这不是很高明吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 52700,
      "end_ms": 54980,
      "text": "很有辨证法的思维在里面吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 55680,
      "end_ms": 58540,
      "text": "其实这个时候你就要理解什么叫存在呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 58940,
      "end_ms": 60320,
      "text": "在海这个人看来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 60320,
      "end_ms": 63800,
      "text": "或者我认为是在一种鲜明的古希腊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 63800,
      "end_ms": 65269,
      "text": "还有我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 65269,
      "end_ms": 67310,
      "text": "你当然可以说我是海德格尔主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 67310,
      "end_ms": 67790,
      "text": "没问题啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 67790,
      "end_ms": 69320,
      "text": "在海德格尔出来看来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 69320,
      "end_ms": 70340,
      "text": "所谓的存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 70340,
      "end_ms": 74420,
      "text": "它并不是冷冰冰的停留在那个地方"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 74420,
      "end_ms": 76880,
      "text": "就是凭空就在那里"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 76880,
      "end_ms": 77840,
      "text": "一直在那里"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 77840,
      "end_ms": 79010,
      "text": "这不是存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 79010,
      "end_ms": 80600,
      "text": "在孩子看来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 80600,
      "end_ms": 85230,
      "text": "存在就是这个escaped"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 85230,
      "end_ms": 87600,
      "text": "用那个呃英语说的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 87600,
      "end_ms": 88640,
      "text": "就是it gives"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 88860,
      "end_ms": 91500,
      "text": "就是自己给出自己"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 91500,
      "end_ms": 92820,
      "text": "或者我用中文说的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 92820,
      "end_ms": 94770,
      "text": "所谓的存在就是无中生有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 94770,
      "end_ms": 96619,
      "text": "自己把自己给出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 97000,
      "end_ms": 97840,
      "text": "你了解吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 97840,
      "end_ms": 103090,
      "text": "就是说绝大部分人会认为说这个世界上万事万事万物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 103090,
      "end_ms": 105940,
      "text": "它并不是自己把自己涌现出来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 105940,
      "end_ms": 109429,
      "text": "并不是并不是自己在时间当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 109429,
      "end_ms": 110149,
      "text": "每一个瞬间"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 110149,
      "end_ms": 112549,
      "text": "这些东西都是不停的在自己涌现出"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 112549,
      "end_ms": 113149,
      "text": "他自己"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 113149,
      "end_ms": 114889,
      "text": "绝大部分人不这样想的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 114889,
      "end_ms": 116449,
      "text": "绝大部分人会认为"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 116449,
      "end_ms": 117709,
      "text": "比如说这个杯子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 117709,
      "end_ms": 118729,
      "text": "它就一直在那边吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 118729,
      "end_ms": 119869,
      "text": "那这个杯子呢从哪来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 119869,
      "end_ms": 122689,
      "text": "别人制造它出来的那些元素从哪来制造"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 122689,
      "end_ms": 124189,
      "text": "他们总要用一些材料元素吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 124189,
      "end_ms": 127010,
      "text": "它会最后最后推推推推推推到后面哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 127010,
      "end_ms": 133360,
      "text": "宇宙大爆炸就是说他总是有那么一个他自己不能给出他自己"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 133360,
      "end_ms": 134050,
      "text": "你明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 134050,
      "end_ms": 136060,
      "text": "他自己不能给出他自己"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 136060,
      "end_ms": 138910,
      "text": "就是说绝大部分的佣人会认为"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 138910,
      "end_ms": 140470,
      "text": "要么就是认为哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 140470,
      "end_ms": 142720,
      "text": "比如说这个房子他就是在那边吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 142720,
      "end_ms": 144110,
      "text": "他一直在那边嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 144110,
      "end_ms": 146760,
      "text": "他就是在那边吧对吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 146760,
      "end_ms": 149580,
      "text": "他不需要时时刻刻给出他自己"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 149580,
      "end_ms": 151080,
      "text": "所以这些人他投到里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 151080,
      "end_ms": 153910,
      "text": "就是说存在者是不存在的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 153910,
      "end_ms": 156370,
      "text": "存在者是不能够存在的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 156370,
      "end_ms": 158950,
      "text": "存在者不是it gives itself"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 158950,
      "end_ms": 160180,
      "text": "不是不停涌现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 160180,
      "end_ms": 162760,
      "text": "不停的给出他自身的了解吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 162760,
      "end_ms": 165269,
      "text": "那么他们会认为不存在者存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 165269,
      "end_ms": 166529,
      "text": "不存在者存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 166529,
      "end_ms": 170699,
      "text": "就是说他们会认为有一个场域有一个虚无不停的在涌现出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 170699,
      "end_ms": 173740,
      "text": "这个虚无就是时间或者就是历史"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 173740,
      "end_ms": 175780,
      "text": "或者就是这个世界的一个场域"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 175780,
      "end_ms": 182029,
      "text": "就是说他们认为比如说1+0=1再加零还是一无限加零"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 182029,
      "end_ms": 182730,
      "text": "还是一"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 182730,
      "end_ms": 184830,
      "text": "他认为说这个零我是可以无限加的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 184830,
      "end_ms": 186210,
      "text": "就因为它本身是虚无嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 186210,
      "end_ms": 187170,
      "text": "我可以不停的加"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 187170,
      "end_ms": 187890,
      "text": "不停的涌现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 187890,
      "end_ms": 188490,
      "text": "他不停的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 188490,
      "end_ms": 189540,
      "text": "it gives itself"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 189540,
      "end_ms": 191800,
      "text": "不停的给多多给一个零"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 191800,
      "end_ms": 192520,
      "text": "多给一个零"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 192520,
      "end_ms": 193120,
      "text": "没问题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 193120,
      "end_ms": 195579,
      "text": "因为不存在者存存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 195579,
      "end_ms": 196599,
      "text": "不存在的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 196599,
      "end_ms": 198669,
      "text": "它可以不停地凭空生出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 198669,
      "end_ms": 199659,
      "text": "因为它本身不存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 199659,
      "end_ms": 201220,
      "text": "这不会是下影响吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 201220,
      "end_ms": 205120,
      "text": "所以但绝大部分人会认为时间就是这么一种虚无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 205120,
      "end_ms": 206740,
      "text": "他不停地作为一个虚无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 206740,
      "end_ms": 207640,
      "text": "不停的涌现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 207640,
      "end_ms": 210510,
      "text": "水作为那些所谓存在者的场域"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 210510,
      "end_ms": 214380,
      "text": "让这些存在者在这个涌现出来的场域里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 214380,
      "end_ms": 215660,
      "text": "作为定在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 215660,
      "end_ms": 218960,
      "text": "作为一个尺寸在那边存在着"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 219299,
      "end_ms": 222809,
      "text": "这就是所有人的错误的思维"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 222809,
      "end_ms": 224279,
      "text": "这就是意见之路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 224279,
      "end_ms": 224879,
      "text": "it's wrong"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 224879,
      "end_ms": 225839,
      "text": "totally wrong"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 225839,
      "end_ms": 226900,
      "text": "了解吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 226940,
      "end_ms": 230540,
      "text": "因为他认为万事万物是没有办法给出自身的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 230540,
      "end_ms": 231440,
      "text": "万事万物当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 231440,
      "end_ms": 234320,
      "text": "只有时间这个虚无才可以给给出自身"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 234320,
      "end_ms": 236230,
      "text": "然后万事万物必须依靠"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 236230,
      "end_ms": 240550,
      "text": "实际上我我得你在在你这里买个买个诸位买个地盘"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 240550,
      "end_ms": 242040,
      "text": "我才能在你这里存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 242040,
      "end_ms": 244380,
      "text": "我猜是在你这已经是一个派生性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 244380,
      "end_ms": 245520,
      "text": "不是他自己给出自己的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 245520,
      "end_ms": 247140,
      "text": "而是时间让它存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 247140,
      "end_ms": 248160,
      "text": "我给你一席之地"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 248160,
      "end_ms": 249030,
      "text": "让你存在了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 249030,
      "end_ms": 251310,
      "text": "这就是意见之路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 251310,
      "end_ms": 251970,
      "text": "了解吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 251970,
      "end_ms": 252870,
      "text": "这就是wrong"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 252870,
      "end_ms": 253530,
      "text": "totally wrong"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 253530,
